--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Incorporated code (bundled in this repository)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

headunit-revived ("Open Headunit") — AGPL-3.0
  The `io.motohub.android.aa` package — AAP transport, TLS/SSL handshake,
  message reading and handling, video decoder, the generated protobuf message
  classes under `aa/proto/`, and related helpers — is ported and adapted from
  the headunit-revived project by Andre Knieriem, itself described by its author
  as a revived version of the original "headunit" by Michael Reid.
  Original work Copyright (C) the headunit lineage authors and their respective
  contributors. Licensed under AGPL-3.0.
    Upstream: https://github.com/andreknieriem/headunit-revived
    Original: https://github.com/mikereidis/headunit

  The port is adapted rather than verbatim: it is trimmed to a video-only,
  headless projection path (no audio decoder, audio manager, microphone
  recorder or settings UI) and driven over a loopback "self mode" socket.
  Individual ported files carry MOTO-HUB's own SPDX headers alongside this
  attribution; the underlying AGPLv3 obligations are unchanged by that.

ridedaemon / hudlib — GPL-3.0
  `apps/android/app/libs/hudlib.aar` and `hudlib-sources.jar` are built from
  ridedaemon-lib, whose implementation originates with charliecharlieO-o
  ("Charles"). Licensed under GPL-3.0.
    Upstream: https://github.com/vincenzobpt/ridedaemon-lib
    Related:  https://github.com/charliecharlieO-o/ridedaemon-android

