Third-party dependencies (fetched at build time, not vendored)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Everything else MOTO-HUB builds against — the AndroidX and Jetpack Compose
libraries, Kotlin and its coroutines, Conscrypt, and the other declared Gradle
dependencies — is resolved at build time from public repositories and is not
redistributed in this repository. Those components remain under their own
licenses, which are not affected by this file.
